SUMMARY:Watercolor Club with Jo Davis
DESCRIPTION:A low-pressure\, high-play painting hour. This is not a still l
 ife class—it’s about painting from within. Come as you are\, grab your
  favorite supplies\, and explore color\, gesture\, and mood. Jo offers sim
 ple prompts and intuitive guidance to help you loosen up and discover your
  own abstract style—no experience needed! Join us in the Art Bar on Frid
 ays from 3:00-4:00 pm! This is an all-ages class! Cost: $15 - Payment is d
 ue to the instructor at the beginning of class! What to expect: Short warm
 -ups to get out of your head Guided prompts for expressive\, intuitive pai
 nting Tips on color\, composition\, and letting go of “perfect” A rela
 xed studio vibe—drop in and make at your own pace What to bring: Your fa
 vorite painting supplies\, or use what Jo has on hand Clothes you don’t 
 mind getting paint on Optional: newsprint pad or sketchbook for warm-ups A
 bout Jo Davis: Jo is an artist and facilitator who loves helping people re
 connect with creativity through process-driven play. Her classes focus on 
 curiosity\, color\, and finding your own visual rhythm. Learn more at www.
